:: RobinTemple Bed Afternoon
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.templePromised is 'Robin' and $robinromance is 1
  and !$RobinTemple.punish and !$robinmissing
  and getRobinLocation() is 'temple' and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80
  and $robin.timer.hurt is 0 and !Time.schoolDay and !Time.isWeekEnd()
  and Time.hour gte 13 and Time.hour lt 16>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin sets down the work list and joins you beside <<his>> bunk. The other initiates are occupied elsewhere. <<He>> draws the folding screen across the empty row, then sits with you on the edge of the mattress.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾放下工作表，来到自己的床铺旁。其他见习教徒都在别处忙碌。<<He>>拉上这一排床铺的屏风，挨着你坐在床垫边缘。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "I meant what I said at the altar," <<he>> says. "Even when I've got work, or the orphanage needs me."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      “我在圣坛前说的话是真心的，”<<he>>说，“就算我还要照顾生意、回孤儿院，也是一样。”
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Ask Robin how the new vow feels', '问罗宾是否习惯了新的誓言'] 'RobinTemple Bed Afternoon Talk'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<loveicon 'kiss'>><<lanLink ['Ask Robin if they want to be closer', '问罗宾要不要更亲近些'] 'RobinTemple Bed Afternoon Invite'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin is not at the bunk now.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾现在不在床铺旁。
  <</language>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<icon 'temple/robin-temple-bed.png'>><<lanLink ['Return to the bunk', '回到床边'] 'RobinTemple Bunk'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Bed Afternoon Talk
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.templePromised is 'Robin' and !$robinmissing
  and getRobinLocation() is 'temple' and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80>>
  <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "I meant it," <<he>> says quietly. "I just... some days I still worry I'll do something wrong." You let <<him>> finish. After a while, <<he>> looks up. "Could we talk here again tomorrow?"
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “我是真心的，”<<he>>轻声说，“只是……有时候还是怕自己做错什么。”你等<<him>>把话说完。过了一会儿，<<he>>抬起头。“明天还能在这里说说话吗？”
    <</language>>
  <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gte 50>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin smiles at you. "I don't know how everything will turn out. But if something's bothering you, tell me. I want to help too."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾朝你笑了笑。“以后会怎样，我也不知道。不过，你要是有心事，就告诉我。我也想帮得上忙。”
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "I'm glad we did it," <<he>> says. "I wanted to tell you earlier, but there were so many people." <<He>> gives you a small smile. "It's easier when it's just us."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “能和你一起立誓，我很高兴，”<<he>>说，“刚才就想告诉你，可是人太多了。”<<He>>朝你露出一个小小的笑容。“只有我们两个的时候，就容易说出口了。”
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      When the next shift's bell rings, Robin gets up and checks the work list. Before leaving, <<he>> looks back to make sure you're coming too.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      下一班的钟声响起，罗宾站起来，查看工作表。离开前，<<he>>又回头看看，确认你也跟上了。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin has already left.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾已经离开了。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<icon 'temple/robin-temple-bed.png'>><<lanLink ['Return to the bunk', '回到床边'] 'RobinTemple Bunk'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Bed Afternoon Invite
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.templePromised is 'Robin' and $robinromance is 1
  and !$RobinTemple.punish and !$robinmissing
  and getRobinLocation() is 'temple' and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80
  and $robin.timer.hurt is 0>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin looks at you. "Only if we both want to," <<he>> says, waiting.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾看着你。“得我们都愿意才行，”<<he>>说，等着你的回答。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "I still get nervous," <<he>> admits quietly. "But I want to try. I want... your hands, and yours on mine. Just go slow, and stop if I ask."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “我还是会紧张，”<<he>>低声说，“可是我想试试。想要……你的手，也想碰碰你。慢一点就好，我说停的时候就停。”
    <</language>>
  <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gte 50>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "I've been thinking about this," <<he>> murmurs, close to your ear. "All day. About... being close to you. Until neither of us can think about anything else. Only if you want it too."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “这件事我想了一整天，”<<he>>凑到你耳边低声说，“想和你贴得很近，近到谁都想不了别的。你要是也愿意，就告诉我。”
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "I keep imagining it," <<he>> confesses, face warm. "Being close to you. Your hands, and mine. I'd like that... only if you want it too."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “我一直在想象，”<<he>>红着脸轻声说，“和你靠得很近。你的手，还有我的手。我想那样……只有你也愿意才行。”
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<loveicon 'kiss'>><<lanLink ['Make love with Robin', '与罗宾做爱'] 'RobinTemple Bed Sex'>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</lanLink>><<promiscuous1>><<kissvirginitywarning>><<NPCvirginitywarning 'Robin' 'kiss'>><br>
  <<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink ['Just hold Robin for a while', '只抱着罗宾待一会儿'] 'RobinTemple Bed Afternoon Hold'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin cannot stay with you now.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾现在不能留下陪你。
  <</language>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<icon 'temple/robin-temple-bed.png'>><<lanLink ['Return to the bunk', '回到床边'] 'RobinTemple Bunk'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Bed Afternoon Hold
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.templePromised is 'Robin' and $robinromance is 1
  and !$robinmissing and getRobinLocation() is 'temple'
  and C.npc.Robin.trauma lt 80>>
  <<if C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You ask whether Robin would like a hug. <<He>> nods, and you leave <<him>> to decide when to let go. "Could you stay a little longer?" <<he>> asks. You sit together without making <<him>> explain. When the bell rings, <<he>> lets go and thanks you quietly.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你问罗宾要不要一个拥抱。<<He>>点点头，你让<<him>>自己决定什么时候松开。“能再陪我一会儿吗？”<<he>>问。你陪<<him>>坐着，没有追问缘由。钟声响起时，<<he>>松开你，轻声道了谢。
    <</language>>
  <<elseif C.npc.Robin.dom gte 50>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin opens <<his>> arms, smiling. "I was hoping you'd say that." When the next shift's bell rings, <<he>> gives a reluctant sigh, then stands. "Come on. If we finish the list together, it won't take so long."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾笑着张开双臂。“我还盼着你这么说呢。”下一班的钟声响起时，<<he>>有些不舍地叹了口气，随后站起来。“走吧。一起把表上的活做完，就不用忙那么久了。”
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Just a hug?" Robin asks. You nod, and <<he>> hugs you back. For a while, neither of you says anything. "This is nice," <<he>> says at last, looking a little embarrassed by the words. When the bell rings, you help <<him>> fold the screen back.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “就抱一会儿？”罗宾问。你点点头，<<he>>也抱住了你。你们安静地坐了一阵。“这样就很好，”<<he>>终于说，话出口又有些不好意思。钟声响起后，你帮<<him>>收起屏风。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<npcincr Robin love 1>><<glove>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin has already left.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾已经离开了。
  <</language>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<icon 'temple/robin-temple-bed.png'>><<lanLink ['Return to the bunk', '回到床边'] 'RobinTemple Bunk'>><</lanLink>><br>

